## Decisions and Action Items

* **SCIM Use Cases (`draft-ietf-scim-use-cases`):** The working group will park this document with no plans to publish it as an RFC. It will remain an unpublished reference.
* **SCIM Rules Draft:** Danny Zollner to resubmit the expired adopted rules draft to keep it active.
* **Rechartering:** The chairs and participants will draft new charter text on the mailing list focusing on SCIM extension mechanisms (such as workloads, interoperability profiles, and real-time extensions) rather than a complete rewrite of the core RFCs.

